flowchart LR
  P[Pollers and external inputs] --> O[Accepted observations and facts]
  O --> E[Durable events]
  E --> L[Existing ledger transitions]
  E --> I[Agent inboxes]
  I --> A[Activation intents]
  A --> S[Existing scheduler and dispatcher]
  L --> S
  S --> R[Agent session or bounded script]
  R --> C[Authorized driver commands]
  C --> L
  C --> X[Existing durable effect outbox]
